  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 3.2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="3.2" corresp="#wit-b">Gif he naðor næbbe ne æhta ne oðerne borh, ðone healde hine man to dome.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="3.2" corresp="#wit-h">Gif he naðor næbbe ne æhta ne oðerne borh, ðonne healde hine man to dome.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="3.2" corresp="#wit-q">Si neutrum habeat, nec pecuniam nec alium plegium, tunc seruetur ad iudicandum.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#attenborough" n="3.2" corresp="#wit-h">Gif he naðor næbbe ne æhta ne oðerne borh, ðonne healde hine man to dome.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#attenborough" corresp="#wit-h">If he has neither property nor any other [means of providing] security, then he shall be kept for trial.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Wenn er keines von beiden, weder Vermögen noch sonstige Bürgschaft besitzt, dann werde er verhaftet [bis] zum Gerichtsurtheil.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">If he has neither of the two, neither property nor other surety, then let him be held in custody [until] the court's judgment.</ab>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#liebermann"><ref target="clause:IICn_35">II Cn 35</ref></note>
      </div>
    </body>
